Hi, I am using this code. How can I display results on laravel blade.
```js
search.addWidget(
        instantsearch.widgets.hits({
          container: '#hits',
          templates: {
            empty: 'No results',
            item: '{{hit.name}}'
          },
          hitsPerPage: 6,
          cssClasses: {
            root: 'row',
            item: 'col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6'
          }
        })
      );
```
I am getting error : Use of undefined constant hit - assumed 'hit'

please help.
